{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">由周嘉洛、陳曉華、吳偉豪及戴祖儀等超強年輕陣容主演的TVB新劇《驅魔速遞》，昨日正式舉行煞科宴！一眾演員歷經多月的日夜趕工，除了為劇集落力演出，戲裏戲外更建立起深厚友誼，整個劇組氣氛極佳。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325026023050639_253966478 (1).jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264YJAlsPCVC1791188248.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325026023050639_253966478 (1).jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日前，吳偉豪（Ricco）在社交平台大派福利，分享了多張劇集的幕後花絮照。相中最大亮點，莫過於Ricco激變「大隻仔」，大晒爆肌麒麟臂，超級搶Fo！他更與好兄弟兼好拍檔周嘉洛再度合體，兩人齊齊對住鏡頭「鬥肌」，畫面養眼之餘亦火花四濺，絕對是粉絲們的福音！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325017768801883_253966478.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267NrJ9LcWpV1791188374.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325017768801883_253966478.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了大騷肌肉，花絮照更曝光了劇組私底下的歡樂日常。其中一幕極度惹笑：周嘉洛趁著拍攝空檔，坐在摺椅上「斷電」閉目熟睡；結果慘遭吳偉豪、戴祖儀和陳曉華聯手「整蠱」，三人將他重重包圍，更對著鏡頭擺出各種鬼馬調皮的姿勢瘋狂「打卡」合照。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325033972427414_253966478.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VOJGNl4iFk1791188249.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325033972427414_253966478.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325030155565555_253966478.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FjrCnlLNW01791188248.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"riccong_1791096762_4000325030155565555_253966478.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這個將嘉洛當成「人肉佈景板」的畫面溫馨又爆笑，隔著螢幕都能深深感受到他們合作得有多愉快。難怪Ricco亦感性發文，表示十分享受與這班拍檔合作的時光，更直呼：「希望呢套劇可以快啲同大家見面！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T08:58:48.129999+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}